.* DEFINE: the task menu for defining or changing the system.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='DEFINE'.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKCNTINF PNLGRP=QHSXCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=WRKSYSVAL PNLGRP=QHSVCMD.
:KEYL HELP='KEYS/MENUKEYS' NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DEFINE HELP=HLPDEFINE KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Define or Change the System
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI HELP='DEFINE/OPT1' OPTION=1 ACTION='MENU CFG'.Configuration
:MENUI HELP='DEFINE/OPT2' OPTION=2 ACTION='MENU LICPGM'.Work with licensed programs
:MENUI HELP='DEFINE/OPT3' OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU SECURITY'.Security
:MENUI HELP=WRKCNTINF OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD WRKCNTINF'.Work with support contact information
:MENUI HELP='DEFINE/OPT5' OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU RESOURCE'.System resources
:MENUI HELP='DEFINE/OPT6' OPTION=6 ACTION='MENU PTF'.Program temporary fix
:MENUI HELP=WRKSYSVAL OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD WRKSYSVAL'.Work with system values
:MENUI HELP='DEFINE/OPT9' OPTION=9 ACTION='MENU CRQADM'.Change request administration
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPDEFINE.Define or Change the System - Help
:P.How the system is set up: devices, software, security, fixes and the
system values that shape everything else.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/MENUKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the
option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again
for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F13=Information Assistant
:PD.Shows menu INFO.
:PT.F16=System Main menu
:PD.Shows menu MAIN.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEFINE/OPT1'.Configuration
:P.Option 1. Shows menu CFG&colon. Configuration.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEFINE/OPT2'.Work with licensed programs
:P.Option 2. Shows menu LICPGM&colon. Work with licensed programs.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEFINE/OPT3'.Security
:P.Option 3. Shows menu SECURITY&colon. Security.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEFINE/OPT5'.System resources
:P.Option 5. Shows menu RESOURCE&colon. System resources.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEFINE/OPT6'.Program temporary fix
:P.Option 6. Shows menu PTF&colon. Program temporary fix.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DEFINE/OPT9'.Change request administration
:P.Option 9. Shows menu CRQADM&colon. Change request administration.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
